#     tail -n +N /tmp/regen  # (paste the record block back in below, sorted)
# or simply run `sh scripts/quarantine-surfaces.sh` and diff its stdout
# against the record block below.
#
# `sh scripts/quarantine-surfaces.sh --check` diffs the live tree against
# this exact file (comment/blank lines skipped) — this is QUAR-05's
# regression gate, and it consumes this list verbatim, never a re-derived
# copy (D-05).
#
# Cross-checked against the seven rendering surfaces named in
# 14-RESEARCH.md line 36 (2026-07-31): the query found exactly those
# seven, plus four non-rendering hits that are allowlisted below with
# justification (not an eighth surface — the fourth, `famp-relay`'s wire
# response, postdates 14-RESEARCH.md; it is Phase 17's own machine-to-
# machine relay protocol, added and justified in that phase's plan 04).
# Records map onto the seven as:
#
#   1. famp_inbox (MCP)            -> crates/famp/src/cli/mcp/tools/inbox.rs:228,239
#   2. famp_await (MCP)            -> crates/famp/src/cli/mcp/tools/await_.rs:91
